{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A casual parkour game where players take on the role of a delivery courier. During their downtime between orders, players can freely collect gold coins. Upon receiving orders, they can deliver food across different maps. Completing deliveries within the time limit grants generous rewards. Various obstacles will appear in map levels to block players' progress, requiring specific actions to avoid them. Collect coin items to purchase more equipment and tools in the in-game shop.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3613930?t=1745614651","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3613930?t=1745614651","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613930/bf952ced885978d8fa43951a35b0449008b77ca5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745614651","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613930/bf952ced885978d8fa43951a35b0449008b77ca5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745614651","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A casual parkour game where players take on the role of a delivery courier. During their downtime between orders, players can freely collect gold coins. Upon receiving orders, they can deliver food across different maps. Completing deliveries within the time limit grants generous rewards. Various obstacles will appear in map levels to block players' progress, requiring specific actions to avoid them. Collect coin items to purchase more equipment and tools in the in-game shop.</p>","developers":["Loadomain"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613930/b7ab2fa3dc485d91c0a370bba1d05a76ed154a62/header.jpg?t=1745614651","is_free":false,"